OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786126702
OL,3,CMaternity unit will temporarily shut
OL,4,Cdespite last ditch rescue effort
OL,6,FHealth bosses have confirmed the
OL,7,Fmaternity unit at North Devon District
OL,8,FHospital in Barnstaple will not be
OL,9,Faccepting women in labour after this
OL,10,Fweekend because of concerns about
OL,11,F"unsafe levels of medical staffing".
OL,13,FThere had been hopes that the closure
OL,14,Fof the unit - initially announced on
OL,15,FJuly 27th - might have been averted.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
