OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786126702
OL,3,CMaternity unit will temporarily shut
OL,4,Cdespite last ditch rescue effort
OL,6,FBut after exhausting all available
OL,7,Foptions, the Royal Devon University
OL,8,FHealthcare NHS Foundation Trust said
OL,9,Fthe closure was the "only safe course
OL,10,Fof action" - leaving many women facing
OL,11,Fa 50-mile journey to the closest
OL,12,Fmaternity unit at the Royal Devon and
OL,13,FExeter Hospital.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786126702
OL,3,CMaternity unit will temporarily shut
OL,4,Cdespite last ditch rescue effort
OL,6,FThe trust confirmed the last planned
OL,7,Finductions and c-sections will take
OL,8,Fplace on Friday, 7 August, while the
OL,9,Flast day the unit will be able to
OL,10,Faccept those in spontaneous labour
OL,11,Fwill be Sunday, 9 August. The
OL,12,Ftemporary suspension is in place from
OL,13,FTuesday, 11 August.
OL,15,FCarolyn Mills, the Royal Devon Trust's
OL,16,Fchief nursing officer, said: "This was
OL,17,Fan exceptionally difficult decision to
OL,18,Fmake. Our absolute priority is, and
OL,19,Falways will be, the safety of women,
OL,20,Fbirthing people and their babies.
OL,26,@xD@^OU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786126702
OL,3,CMaternity unit will temporarily shut
OL,4,Cdespite last ditch rescue effort
OL,6,F"We have worked tirelessly alongside
OL,7,Four partners, including NHS Devon,
OL,8,FCornwall and the Isles of Scilly
OL,9,FIntegrated Care Board and NHS England
OL,10,Fregional colleagues, to explore every
OL,11,Fpossible option to avoid this outcome.
OL,13,F"Unfortunately, we have now reached
OL,14,Fthe point where we cannot safely
OL,15,Fprovide the level of medical cover
OL,16,Frequired to continue births at North
OL,17,FDevon District Hospital.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786126702
OL,3,CMaternity unit will temporarily shut
OL,4,Cdespite last ditch rescue effort
OL,6,F"We carefully considered the risks
OL,7,Finvolved. While we recognise the
OL,8,Fadditional travel this will mean for
OL,9,Fsome families, we believe that
OL,10,Fconcentrating services where safe
OL,11,Fmedical staffing can be guaranteed is
OL,12,Fthe safest option for everyone who
OL,13,Frelies on our maternity services."
OL,15,FIn an effort to reassure the public,
OL,16,Fthe trust has contacted over 300 women
OL,17,Fwho are 34 weeks pregnant or more,
OL,18,Falong with those identified as high
OL,19,Frisk, to discuss their individual care
OL,20,Fplans.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786126702
OL,3,CMaternity unit will temporarily shut
OL,4,Cdespite last ditch rescue effort
OL,6,FThe temporary suspension affects
OL,7,Fbirths and face-to-face triage only.
OL,8,FOther services, including community
OL,9,Fmidwifery, scans, birth planning,
OL,10,Fultrasound clinics and antenatal
OL,11,Foutpatient clinics will remain in
OL,12,FNorthern Devon.
OL,14,FA dedicated helpline for pregnant
OL,15,Fwomen is available ` 01271 335773,
OL,16,F(9am-5pm, Monday ` Friday) and the
OL,17,Fmaternity triage line is available 24/
OL,18,F7 for those who require urgent medical
OL,19,Fadvice ` 01392 406616.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,406,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1786126702
OL,3,CMaternity unit will temporarily shut
OL,4,Cdespite last ditch rescue effort
OL,6,FMs Mills added: "While this temporary
OL,7,Fsuspension is deeply disappointing to
OL,8,Four communities, we are fully
OL,9,Fcommitted to reopening birthing
OL,10,Fservices at NDDH as soon as possible.
OL,12,F"A dedicated recovery programme is
OL,13,Falready underway, with intensive work
OL,14,Ffocused on recruitment, workforce
OL,15,Fplanning, staff retention and service
OL,16,Fresilience."
OL,26,@nD@QOUtD@AOUxD@LO]
